{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>ויגע</b>. They called every day of the moon חדש, because it renews every fifteen days." "<b>כאיש אחד</b> — the meaning is that the gathering of the people was swift, like the gathering of one man."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "The lemma 'ויגע' does not occur in Ezra 3:1; it appears the manuscript witnesses preserve a corrupt or misplaced lemma head. Translated as found."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:44.149764223Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}